id=scr01_sms_enable
name=SCR-01 SMS Enable
version=2.2.1
versionCode=5
author=Toko + Deepseek Harness
description=Enables SMS send+receive on the Samsung SCR-01 (data-only 5G router) by making config_sms_capable visible to the framework via a cinnamon theme overlay, forcing the android.app.role.SMS role into the available-role list, and granting it to a configurable default SMS app (Fossify Messages). v2.2 added a built-in APN database (LineageOS android_vendor_apn, Apache-2.0), dual-PLMN APN lookup, a Samsung IMS profile patch, log rotation and collect-logs.sh. v2.2.1 fixes a China Telecom (46011/46003) regression: built-in "ims" APN types are stripped before dedicated IMS APNs are ensured, and both 46011 and 46003 are handled. Mobile data / roaming data can stay OFF: Samsung's always-on IMS PDN still carries SMS. Reversible via uninstall.sh; no real partition is written.
